sys/src/linux/freebsd holds files of FreeBSD (freebsd/, git 584f44221f45c5c26ec2a2888a3815c6f34bfad0) and of
drm-kmod (drm-kmod/, git c16de0f9fa84f70b9551f69fde837a7f3a73c0e9, only its BSD parts), unchanged, each under
its own notice; they follow, each once, with the files they cover.
Our LinuxKPI (sys/src/linux/kpi) is derived from them and from OpenBSD's
(openbsd/) and keeps the notices in the derived files.

